{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_107","type":"agent_message","text":"Direct private-ABI testing is byte-identical for UTF-8, string buffers, hashtable operations, and 23 of 24 dtoa mode cases. The pack tests identified a real optional-value cursor bug: `*` was consumed twice, causing the next format token to be skipped. I’m fixing that control flow, adding the original unexpected-format character and strict-unpack key detail, and matching dtoa mode 3’s rounded-to-empty result."}}
